        "url": "/api/v2/version/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "SPHEAL always travels by rolling\naround on its ball-like body. When the\nseason for ice floes arrives, this\fPOKéMON can be seen rolling about on\nice and crossing the sea.",
